---
title: System Architecture - Multi-Agent Orchestrator
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Inter, system-ui, sans-serif"
    primaryColor: "#F8FAFC"
    primaryBorderColor: "#1E293B"
    primaryTextColor: "#1E293B"
    lineColor: "#64748B"
    clusterBkg: "#E2E8F0"
    clusterBorder: "#94A3B8"
---
flowchart TD
    classDef core     fill:#6366F1,stroke:#1E293B,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef data     fill:#10B981,stroke:#1E293B,color:#ffffff,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef external fill:#F59E0B,stroke:#1E293B,color:#1E293B,stroke-width:1px;

    Goal([Goal]):::external
    Orchestrator[Orchestrator]:::core
    Board[(Blackboard)]:::data

    Planner[Planner]:::core
    Worker[Workers]:::core
    Critic[Critic]:::core

    Goal --> Orchestrator
    Orchestrator -->|1 plan| Planner
    Planner -->|subtasks| Board
    Orchestrator -->|2 dispatch ready| Worker
    Worker -->|results| Board
    Orchestrator -->|3 review| Critic
    Critic -->|approve / reject| Board
    Board -.->|progress| Orchestrator
    Orchestrator -->|final outputs| Goal
